My question be: Wetin fit cause this kind problem after woman don born? Pain for under belle fit be signs of sickness? Which danger signs wey new mama suppose watch out for after childbirth? And wetin be the steps wey new mama need to take to prevent this kind sickness?", "answer": "Aunty, e be danger of miscarriage, e fit be called incomplete miscarriage. E be important to go hospital immediately for check-up. Doctor will do examination and maybe blood test or ultrasound to know the situation. If e fit be miscarriage, doctor will give medicine to clean inside belly and prevent infection. Aunty, e fit be careful and see doctor right away to know what fit happen and how to care for herself.", "Answer is correct and consistent with scientific consensus": "1", "Diagnostics or Management is appropriate for rural African community health setting": "1", "Answer could cause harm or risk safety and wellbeing": "5", "Context is complete and Additional Info is not required OR Context is incomplete and Additional Info is required": "4"}

{"question": "Good evening. I come because of my younger sibling. I notice say hin eye and skin don begin turn yellow. This thing don dey happen for three days now. Hin body too dey very hot, fever dey worry am, and e no fit chop anything. Anything wey hin chop no dey stay hin belle. E dey vomit everything. As if that one no reach, e dey shake well well because hin head dey pain am and hin whole body dey burn with fever.

We don try give am some medicine for house, but nothing don change. That yellow color for hin eye and skin no gree stop, instead e dey increase everyday. E no dey comfortable at all, e dey really suffer. God forbid, e dey suffer too much. Na why I come hospital make una help us know wetin dey happen and wetin we suppose do. So that my younger sibling go recover and the yellow color for hin skin and eye disappear
", "answer": "Aunty, this young man is suffering from jaundice. He need to see a doctor for proper diagnosis and treatment. Jaundice is caused by high bilirubin levels in the blood, which can be due to liver problems or other health issues. He need to drink plenty of water, eat a healthy diet, and rest. If symptoms worsen, he need to seek medical help immediately.", "Answer is correct and consistent with scientific consensus": "2", "Diagnostics or Management is appropriate for rural African community health setting": "2", "Answer could cause harm or risk safety and wellbeing": "4", "Context is complete and Additional Info is not required OR Context is incomplete and Additional Info is required": "5"}

{"question": "One woman wey get belle for six months we dey stay our house begin notice say hin heart dey beat fast fast like person wey just finish race. Sometimes e go just just Dey tire even though e never do any work and hin hand dey shake small small.
After some weeks, e come notice say front of hin neck begin swell. As people begin tell am say hin neck no be like before again, fear catch am. E begin wonder whether Na one of the sickness wey dey affect women wey get belle or whether Na another problem entirely.

Now e don decide say e wan go see doctor make dem check wetin dey cause am. My question be say wetin fit make pregnant woman heart dey beat fast like person wey just run finish, with neck swelling? This problem fit affect the growth and development of the pikin wey dey hin belle? Wetin be the danger signs wey dey suppose watch out for while dem dey house? And e get any type of food and drink wey dem suppose avoid, or any wey e suppose chop and drink during this kind time?", "answer": "Aye, woman wey get belle, heart beat fast, neck swelling, and tiredness, she may dey have preeclampsia. This sickness, it dangerous for both her and baby, so she need to see doctor right away. Doctor will check blood pressure, protein in urine, and other signs. Woman should avoid salty foods, drink lots of water, and eat healthy. Doctor may give medicine to help her and baby safe. She must go hospital if symptoms get worse. No food or drink she should avoid, but doctor tell her specific things. Always follow doctor advice for safety.", "Answer is correct and consistent with scientific consensus": "1", "Diagnostics or Management is appropriate for rural African community health setting": "1", "Answer could cause harm or risk safety and wellbeing": "2", "Context is complete and Additional Info is not required OR Context is incomplete and Additional Info is required": "1"}

{"question": "One woman notice say anytime wey dem wake up for morning, her husband go begin cough well well. The cough dey start suddenly and e fit take long time before e go stop. As time dey go, she notice say her husband no fit breathe well again. Anytime wey e waka small distance or climb staircase, e go stop make e catch breath because e dey tire quick quick.

One day, after her husband don spend long time dey cough and dey struggle to catch breath, the woman come fear. E begin think say maybe one sickness dey cause all these problems. The next day, she talk to her husband make dem go hospital go see doctor so dat doctor go fit examine am and know wetin dey really happen.

The question be say, wetin fit make person dey cough like this, with constant tiredness and serious difficulty to breathe anytime the cough start? Na only lung sickness or heart sickness fit cause this kind problem? Which kind sickness fit make person struggle to breathe so much or even cause death if dem no get urgent treatment? Wetin be the danger signs of cough and breathing problem wey family members suppose watch out for, wey mean say the person need urgent medical attention?", "answer": "Dis kain cough wey dey start for morning and difficulty to breathe wen person waka small fit be sign of **heart failure**, **asthma**, **COPD**, or **TB**. Heart failure dey cause fluid for lung wey dey worse for morning and wen person dey do work, e fit kill quick if dem no treat am. Asthma and COPD dey block airway, TB dey destroy lung, all of dem fit cause serious breathing problem and death without urgent treatment. Danger signs na: breathing fast-fast, chest dey pain, lips or nails dey turn blue, person dey confuse or faint, cough blood, or e no fit lie down flat. Make una run go hospital now now for oxygen, X-ray, ECG, and blood test so doctor fit know exact sickness and start treatment.", "Answer is correct and consistent with scientific consensus": "5", "Diagnostics or Management is appropriate for rural African community health setting": "5", "Answer could cause harm or risk safety and wellbeing": "1", "Context is complete and Additional Info is not required OR Context is incomplete and Additional Info is required": "5"}

{"question": "One mama wey dey always bring her pikin come for injection talk say she don notice say her newborn baby get problem for mouth area, and the baby lips dey look blue.

Today too, she notice say anytime she dey breastfeed the baby, the baby dey struggle, dey gasp for air, and e dey find am hard to breathe well. She say na this one make her worry because she no know wetin dey happen to the baby.

Wetin fit make newborn baby lips dey look blue? Wetin fit make baby dey struggle and find am hard to breathe anytime e dey suck breast? Medicine fit solve the problem, abi the baby need make doctor examine am first?", "answer": "Aunty, the baby is having trouble breathing because of a condition called meconium aspiration syndrome. This happens when the baby breathes in the thick greenish substance called meconium before birth. It can cause the baby's airways to become blocked, leading to difficulty breathing. The baby may also have a bluish color to the lips and face due to lack of oxygen. It is important to seek medical attention immediately to help the baby breathe better and prevent further complications.", "Answer is correct and consistent with scientific consensus": "1", "Diagnostics or Management is appropriate for rural African community health setting": "1", "Answer could cause harm or risk safety and wellbeing": "5", "Context is complete and Additional Info is not required OR Context is incomplete and Additional Info is required": "1"}

{"question": "One woman notice say for the past few days, pikin don dey cough without stopping. At first, she think say na ordinary cold wey catch the pikin for chest and say e go clear by itself. But the cough no gree stop. Every night, the pikin dey wake up suddenly because of the cough. Sometimes, e go dey struggle like say e hard am to breathe well.The woman go carry the pikin upright, and she fit hear the chest dey make sound and dey work hard as the pikin dey breathe. Because of this, the pikin no fit sleep well for night.

One day, after one night wey the pikin cough well-well and dey struggle to breathe properly, the woman decide say she must carry the pikin go hospital. She want know wetin dey cause the cough, wetin dey make the pikin find am hard to breathe, and how she fit help the pikin.

My question be: wetin fit make pikin cough seriously and find am hard to breathe, especially for night? Which kind danger signs dem suppose watch out for when pikin dey cough? Which things dem suppose avoid to help prevent or reduce this cough?", "answer": "Dis cough fit be bronchiolitis, asthma, or pneumonia wey dey worse for night. Danger signs na fast breathing, chest indrawing, blue lips, high fever, or pikin too weak to suck breast. Make you rush go hospital now for oxygen, nebulizer, and antibiotics if infection dey. Avoid smoke, cold air, and overcrowded room; keep pikin upright and breastfeed well. No give cough syrup or herbs without doctor talk.", "Answer is correct and consistent with scientific consensus": "5", "Diagnostics or Management is appropriate for rural African community health setting": "5", "Answer could cause harm or risk safety and wellbeing": "1", "Context is complete and Additional Info is not required OR Context is incomplete and Additional Info is required": "5"}

{"question": "One woman wey get belle for six months we dey stay our house begin notice say hin heart dey beat fast fast like person wey just finish race. Sometimes e go just just Dey tire even though e never do any work and hin hand dey shake small small.
After some weeks, e come notice say front of hin neck begin swell. As people begin tell am say hin neck no be like before again, fear catch am. E begin wonder whether Na one of the sickness wey dey affect women wey get belle or whether Na another problem entirely.

Now e don decide say e wan go see doctor make dem check wetin dey cause am. My question be say wetin fit make pregnant woman heart dey beat fast like person wey just run finish, with neck swelling? This problem fit affect the growth and development of the pikin wey dey hin belle? Wetin be the danger signs wey dey suppose watch out for while dem dey house? And e get any type of food and drink wey dem suppose avoid, or any wey e suppose chop and drink during this kind time?", "answer": "Dis woman fit get hyperthyroidism (overactive thyroid) wey dey cause fast heartbeat, hand shake, tire, and neck swelling (goitre); pregnancy fit trigger am or make am worse. If dem no treat am well, e fit cause miscarriage, preterm birth, low birth weight, or pre-eclampsia wey fit affect pikin growth. Danger signs na: heartbeat pass 100 per minute for rest, serious heat, vomiting wey no stop, vaginal bleeding, severe headache, or baby movement reduce. Make dem avoid too much iodine (like plenty seaweed or iodine supplement), caffeine, and alcohol; make dem chop balanced diet with vegetables, protein, and continue routine antenatal drugs. Make she run go hospital quick for thyroid function test and obstetric review.", "Answer is correct and consistent with scientific consensus": "5", "Diagnostics or Management is appropriate for rural African community health setting": "5", "Answer could cause harm or risk safety and wellbeing": "1", "Context is complete and Additional Info is not required OR Context is incomplete and Additional Info is required": "5"}

{"question": "One woman wey get belle for six months we dey stay our house begin notice say hin heart dey beat fast fast like person wey just finish race. Sometimes e go just just Dey tire even though e never do any work and hin hand dey shake small small.
After some weeks, e come notice say front of hin neck begin swell. As people begin tell am say hin neck no be like before again, fear catch am. E begin wonder whether Na one of the sickness wey dey affect women wey get belle or whether Na another problem entirely.

Now e don decide say e wan go see doctor make dem check wetin dey cause am. My question be say wetin fit make pregnant woman heart dey beat fast like person wey just run finish, with neck swelling? This problem fit affect the growth and development of the pikin wey dey hin belle? Wetin be the danger signs wey dey suppose watch out for while dem dey house? And e get any type of food and drink wey dem suppose avoid, or any wey e suppose chop and drink during this kind time?", "answer": "Dis woman fit get hyperthyroidism (overactive thyroid) wey dey cause fast heartbeat, hand shake, tire, and neck swelling (goitre); pregnancy fit trigger am or make am worse. If dem no treat am well, e fit cause miscarriage, preterm birth, low birth weight, or pre-eclampsia wey fit affect pikin growth. Danger signs na: heartbeat pass 100 per minute for rest, serious heat, vomiting wey no stop, vaginal bleeding, severe headache, or baby movement reduce. Make dem avoid too much iodine (like plenty seaweed or iodine supplement), caffeine, and alcohol; make dem chop balanced diet with vegetables, protein, and continue routine antenatal drugs. Make she run go hospital quick for thyroid function test and obstetric review.", "Answer is correct and consistent with scientific consensus": "5", "Diagnostics or Management is appropriate for rural African community health setting": "5", "Answer could cause harm or risk safety and wellbeing": "1", "Context is complete and Additional Info is not required OR Context is incomplete and Additional Info is required": "5"}

{"question": "Mama wey born pikin two weeks ago begin dey see small small blood dey come out from her body As days dey pass e notice say wetin resemble meat or tissue and blood dey come out Sometimes e dey feel somehow and e neck no dey okay E still dey get small small pain for under belle and anytime he see all these signs e dey fear and go confuse He begin wonder wetin dey happen say na normal thing wey fit happen after woman born pikin or whether na another sickness One day as e go hospital and dey talk with other nursemers hear say make nobody ignore any change wey dem notice for their body after child birth That one make am decide say he go see dr meet in examine My question be wetin fit cause this kind problem after woman don born Pain for under belle fit be signs of sickness which denter signs When new mama suppose watch out for after chike bath and wetin be the steps wey new mama need take to prevent this kind sickness", "answer": "**Wetin fit dey cause am:** Dis kind problem wey mama dey see blood, tissue or meat wey dey comot after two weeks fit be say small piece of placenta or membrane remain for inside womb (dem dey call am *retained products of conception*), or na infection for womb (*endometritis*), abi na normal lochia wey neva finish. If e get bad smell, fever, plenty bleeding or that meat-like tissue, e fit mean say infection dey or something remain inside wey no comot well.

**Danger signs wey mama suppose watch:** Make she watch out for heavy bleeding wey dey soak pad quick-quick, blood clots wey big, bad-smell discharge, fever or cold body wey dey shake am, strong pain for under belle, and if she dey feel weak, dizzy abi her heart dey beat fast — all dis na sign say she suppose rush hospital sharp-sharp.

**Steps to prevent am:** Make she go antenatal and postnatal check-up well, allow doctor confirm say the whole placenta don comot after she born, keep herself clean for down there, no dey put anything wey no clean inside, breastfeed pikin (e dey help womb close well), and if she notice any strange change, make she no ignore am but go see doctor quick. Doctor go fit do scan check am and if tissue remain, dem go clean the womb (D&C) or give antibiotics if na infection.", "Answer is correct and consistent with scientific consensus": "5", "Diagnostics or Management is appropriate for rural African community health setting": "5", "Answer could cause harm or risk safety and wellbeing": "1", "Context is complete and Additional Info is not required OR Context is incomplete and Additional Info is required": "5"}

{"question": "Good evening dr abeg I bring my pikin come hospital because I notice say anytime wey e dey breathe e dey make sound like say dey pass through small hole E dey sound like wheezing E still dey sound like person wey dey blow risle and e dey struggle to breathe well I don also notice say for about 3 days now E dey cough mostly for night Sometimes I dey see say his chest dey go inside and come outside well well like say he dey use plenty power just to breathe I still notice say he no fit chop well like before Anytime wey he wan chop he go 1st stop make e catch breath Because of this problem he never fit feed well for your body About 3 days now I don carry am go chemist for our area before and dem give am cough medicine because he been dey cough small small although di cough no too much After he take di medicine I notice say e no work E still dey breathe Like before Uhm he still no fit chop well Abeg wetin fit be the sickness wey dey make my pikin dey breathe with dis wheeze E need chest examination chest x ray to know wetin dey worry am and why him chest dey draw go inside and come outside Wetin be the treatment wey I fit give dis pikin for house to help me breathe better Ba medicine or new other way dey wey I fit use help am make e breathe well", "answer": "Good evening. Wetin your pikin dey show me—di wheezing (whistle sound), cough wey worse for night, chest wey dey draw go inside (retraction), and di way e dey stop to catch breath when e wan chop—all dey point to say di pikin get **bronchiolitis** (if e dey below 2 years) or **asthma** wey dey worsen. Dis one na sign of **respiratory distress**, e mean say di pikin dey struggle serious to breathe, and e no be small matter at all.

**I no want make you try treat dis one for house o.** Di chest wey dey draw go inside, wheezing, and pikin wey no fit feed—na danger signs wey mean say di pikin need hospital NOW-NOW, no be chemist. For hospital, dem go fit check di oxygen level, do chest examination, give nebuliser (salbutamol) or oxygen, and maybe chest X-ray to know wetin dey worry am well.

Abeg carry di pikin go hospital sharp-sharp before e turn emergency, because dis kind breathing problem fit worse quick-quick for small pikin. As you dey go, keep di pikin upright (make e siddon or you carry am), give small small breast milk or water if e fit swallow, and no give any more cough medicine. Time dey important—make you go now.", "Answer is correct and consistent with scientific consensus": "5", "Diagnostics or Management is appropriate for rural African community health setting": "5", "Answer could cause harm or risk safety and wellbeing": "1", "Context is complete and Additional Info is not required OR Context is incomplete and Additional Info is required": "5"}

{"question": "One mama of one woman wey been just born come hospital She say since her pikin born she don de bleed well well and as e happen like so her body no come strong again The woman wey born na 24 years she be She bin also talk say the bleeding plenty well well and e de make am feel weak The mama no dey She no dey fit chop well and she no dey fit do anything My question be say wetin fit make woman to dey bleed after she just born some days ago Which treatment dem suppose give the mama wey go stop the bleeding and help am strong again Which advice them fit give this mama and her pikin so I", "answer": "Wetin dey cause this heavy bleeding after some days wey woman born (wetin we dey call secondary postpartum hemorrhage) fit be say piece of placenta (afterbirth) still remain for her womb, infection dey inside, or because the womb never shrink back well.

She need to go hospital sharp-sharp make doctor check her, give her drips, blood transfusion if her blood don short well well, and medicines like oxytocin or misoprostol to stop the bleeding. If na piece of placenta still dey inside, doctor fit need to clean her womb (MVA or evacuation) so the bleeding go stop patapata, and give her antibiotics for infection.

For advice, make the mama dey chop food wey go give her blood like green vegetables, meat, and fish, and make she rest well without doing heavy work. Also, make she dey breastfeed the baby well because breastfeeding dey help the womb to shrink back quick, and make una ensure say both mama and baby dey clean always to avoid infection.", "Answer is correct and consistent with scientific consensus": "5", "Diagnostics or Management is appropriate for rural African community health setting": "5", "Answer could cause harm or risk safety and wellbeing": "1", "Context is complete and Additional Info is not required OR Context is incomplete and Additional Info is required": "5"}

{"question": "One woman notice say for the past few days, pikin don dey cough without stopping. At first, she think say na ordinary cold wey catch the pikin for chest and say e go clear by itself. But the cough no gree stop. Every night, the pikin dey wake up suddenly because of the cough. Sometimes, e go dey struggle like say e hard am to breathe well.The woman go carry the pikin upright, and she fit hear the chest dey make sound and dey work hard as the pikin dey breathe. Because of this, the pikin no fit sleep well for night.

One day, after one night wey the pikin cough well-well and dey struggle to breathe properly, the woman decide say she must carry the pikin go hospital. She want know wetin dey cause the cough, wetin dey make the pikin find am hard to breathe, and how she fit help the pikin.

My question be: wetin fit make pikin cough seriously and find am hard to breathe, especially for night? Which kind danger signs dem suppose watch out for when pikin dey cough? Which things dem suppose avoid to help prevent or reduce this cough?", "answer": "The coughing may be due to persistent irritation, such as from asthma, bronchitis, or persistent post-nasal drip, especially since it worsens at night. To alleviate the cough, she should use over-the-counter cough suppressants like dextromethorphan, or expectorants like guaifenesin, to soothe the throat and loosen mucus. She should also avoid triggers like smoke and dust, and use a humidifier or steam inhalation at night. If the cough persists or is accompanied by fever or difficulty breathing, she should see a doctor for further evaluation and potential prescription medication.", "Answer is correct and consistent with scientific consensus": "1", "Diagnostics or Management is appropriate for rural African community health setting": "1", "Answer could cause harm or risk safety and wellbeing": "5", "Context is complete and Additional Info is not required OR Context is incomplete and Additional Info is required": "1"}

{"question": "Good evening. I come because of my younger sibling. I notice say hin eye and skin don begin turn yellow. This thing don dey happen for three days now. Hin body too dey very hot, fever dey worry am, and e no fit chop anything. Anything wey hin chop no dey stay hin belle. E dey vomit everything. As if that one no reach, e dey shake well well because hin head dey pain am and hin whole body dey burn with fever.

We don try give am some medicine for house, but nothing don change. That yellow color for hin eye and skin no gree stop, instead e dey increase everyday. E no dey comfortable at all, e dey really suffer. God forbid, e dey suffer too much. Na why I come hospital make una help us know wetin dey happen and wetin we suppose do. So that my younger sibling go recover and the yellow color for hin skin and eye disappear
", "answer": "Abeg, carry your pikin come hospital sharp-sharp because dis yellow color for eye and skin (jaundice) plus fever fit mean say him liver dey struggle or he get serious infection like Hepatitis or severe Malaria. Since he no fit chop and he dey vomit everything, him body fit dey dry fast, and we need to check him blood and liver function immediately. The yellow color dey increase because the bilirubin for him blood too much, and we need to give am IV fluids and proper drugs to clear the infection. No try give am any medicine for house again because e fit make the liver condition worse. We go treat am well for hospital to make sure the yellow color go away and he go fit chop again.", "Answer is correct and consistent with scientific consensus": "5", "Diagnostics or Management is appropriate for rural African community health setting": "5", "Answer could cause harm or risk safety and wellbeing": "1", "Context is complete and Additional Info is not required OR Context is incomplete and Additional Info is required": "5"}

{"question": "why old papa come among local hospital di papa talk say he get serious edic him neck di stiff and raj don't old any comer for him body he come as wey tin fi custom and we tin with correct treatment we ask em whether the headache start suddenly or it dey come small small di papa say he start suddenly for night and he now it don't become very severe you still ask em whether he fit look like to air when he say no because like they make the head the cross we ask em about the rush we the embody whether he dey penal whether he plenty or he just more the papa say the rush the all over embody in fit point one place and the each and change after that we ask whether he don contact with anybody wey sick recently the papa say them no go anyway apart from where them they sell goods for front of the house and them no know anybody wey sick wey them don get contact with our question for doctor be wetin fit cause this kind serious adeque and steve neck wey make personal photonym neck plus rush all over the body wetin feel be the cause na infectious disease one another sickness our second question be which kind tests this papa suppose do to know exactly wetin they worry yam make you fit get correct treatments and which medicines them fit starts give yam before the test results to commerce", "answer": "This strong headache, stiff neck, fear of light, and rash for body fit be sign of **Meningitis** (infection of the brain cover), wey be serious infectious disease wey dey common for our environment. The way the sickness take start suddenly and the rash wey spread join show say e fit be bacterial meningitis (like meningococcemia), wey be bad medical emergency.

To know the exact thing wey dey worry the papa, he need to do **Lumbar Puncture** (to test the liquid for him back spine), **Blood Culture**, and **Full Blood Count (FBC)** with **Malaria test** sharp-sharp. Before the test result ready, doctor suppose start am on powerful injection antibiotics like **Ceftriaxone** (plus Ampicillin because of him old age to cover Listeria germ) and injection **Dexamethasone** to protect him brain from swelling.

Abeg, make una admit the papa for hospital immediately make he fit get drip (IV fluids) and pain relief, because any small delay fit lead to brain damage or death.", "Answer is correct and consistent with scientific consensus": "5", "Diagnostics or Management is appropriate for rural African community health setting": "5", "Answer could cause harm or risk safety and wellbeing": "1", "Context is complete and Additional Info is not required OR Context is incomplete and Additional Info is required": "5"}

{"question": "Mama wey born pikin two weeks ago begin dey see small-small blood dey come from her body. As days dey pass, e notice say wetin resemble meat or tissue and blood dey come out. Sometimes e dey feel somehow, and e neck no dey okay. E still dey get small-small pain for under belle, and anytime e see all these signs, e dey fear and confuse. E begin wonder wetin dey happen,whether na normal thing wey fit happen after woman born pikin or whether na another sickness.

One day, as e go hospital and dey talk with other nursing mothers, e hear say make nobody ignore any change wey dem notice for their body after childbirth. That one make am decide say e go see doctor make dem examine am.

My question be: Wetin fit cause this kind problem after woman don born? Pain for under belle fit be signs of sickness? Which danger signs wey new mama suppose watch out for after childbirth? And wetin be the steps wey new mama need to take to prevent this kind sickness?", "answer": "Mama, the blood wey dey come out with meat or tissue from your body after birth na serious matter wey fit be heavy bleeding (postpartum hemorrhage) or infection wey dey eat your inside. This fit be sign of uterine infection (endometritis) or wey your womb no close well, and if you no treat am fast, e fit cause severe infection for your blood (sepsis). You must go hospital immediately because e fit be danger to your life if the infection spread. For future, new mama must always tell doctor any bleeding wey get smell, tissue, or if fever start, because early treatment na the only way to save life. Make you no wait for the pain to increase; go see doctor now make dem check your womb and give you correct drugs.", "Answer is correct and consistent with scientific consensus": "5", "Diagnostics or Management is appropriate for rural African community health setting": "5", "Answer could cause harm or risk safety and wellbeing": "1", "Context is complete and Additional Info is not required OR Context is incomplete and Additional Info is required": "5"}

{"question": "One woman notice say anytime wey dem wake up for morning, her husband go begin cough well well. The cough dey start suddenly and e fit take long time before e go stop. As time dey go, she notice say her husband no fit breathe well again. Anytime wey e waka small distance or climb staircase, e go stop make e catch breath because e dey tire quick quick.

One day, after her husband don spend long time dey cough and dey struggle to catch breath, the woman come fear. E begin think say maybe one sickness dey cause all these problems. The next day, she talk to her husband make dem go hospital go see doctor so dat doctor go fit examine am and know wetin dey really happen.

The question be say, wetin fit make person dey cough like this, with constant tiredness and serious difficulty to breathe anytime the cough start? Na only lung sickness or heart sickness fit cause this kind problem? Which kind sickness fit make person struggle to breathe so much or even cause death if dem no get urgent treatment? Wetin be the danger signs of cough and breathing problem wey family members suppose watch out for, wey mean say the person need urgent medical attention?", "answer": "A person dey cough and dey tired quick quick, na fit be lung sickness like TB or pneumonia. Heart sickness like heart failure can also make person struggle to breathe. Danger signs wey family member watch out for include: person dey cough blood, person dey very weak, person dey fever high, person dey lose weight, person dey confused, person dey sweat at night, person dey have chest pain, person dey have bluish lips or fingernails. If person fit fit, dem need urgent treatment. Family member must take person to hospital fast.", "Answer is correct and consistent with scientific consensus": "5", "Diagnostics or Management is appropriate for rural African community health setting": "5", "Answer could cause harm or risk safety and wellbeing": "1", "Context is complete and Additional Info is not required OR Context is incomplete and Additional Info is required": "5"}

{"question": "One woman wey get belle for six months we dey stay our house begin notice say hin heart dey beat fast fast like person wey just finish race. Sometimes e go just just Dey tire even though e never do any work and hin hand dey shake small small.
After some weeks, e come notice say front of hin neck begin swell. As people begin tell am say hin neck no be like before again, fear catch am. E begin wonder whether Na one of the sickness wey dey affect women wey get belle or whether Na another problem entirely.

Now e don decide say e wan go see doctor make dem check wetin dey cause am. My question be say wetin fit make pregnant woman heart dey beat fast like person wey just run finish, with neck swelling? This problem fit affect the growth and development of the pikin wey dey hin belle? Wetin be the danger signs wey dey suppose watch out for while dem dey house? And e get any type of food and drink wey dem suppose avoid, or any wey e suppose chop and drink during this kind time?", "answer": "Aunty, e be danger sign wey fit watch out for when woman get belle, e be heart dey beat fast like person wey just finish race, neck swelling, and hand dey shake. This fit be danger sign of blood pressure problem or infection. Aunty, she fit avoid salty food, alcohol, and high-sodium food while she dem dey house. Aunty, she fit take iron supplement and eat iron-rich food like spinach, beans, and meat. Aunty, she fit go see doctor for proper check-up and treatment.", "Answer is correct and consistent with scientific consensus": "1", "Diagnostics or Management is appropriate for rural African community health setting": "1", "Answer could cause harm or risk safety and wellbeing": "5", "Context is complete and Additional Info is not required OR Context is incomplete and Additional Info is required": "5"}

{"question": "Good evening. I come because of my younger sibling. I notice say hin eye and skin don begin turn yellow. This thing don dey happen for three days now. Hin body too dey very hot, fever dey worry am, and e no fit chop anything. Anything wey hin chop no dey stay hin belle. E dey vomit everything. As if that one no reach, e dey shake well well because hin head dey pain am and hin whole body dey burn with fever.

