", "answer": "Good evening, your brother get serious jaundice with high fever, vomiting, and convulsions wey fit be severe malaria, hepatitis, or sepsis. Him condition critical and e need urgent admission for IV fluids, antimalarials, antibiotics, and anticonvulsants. We go run blood tests like full blood count, malaria parasite, liver function, and blood culture to know exact cause. Early treatment go prevent brain damage or liver failure wey fit kill am. Make una no waste time, carry am go emergency ward now now.", "Answer is correct and consistent with scientific consensus": "5", "Diagnostics or Management is appropriate for rural African community health setting": "5", "Answer could cause harm or risk safety and wellbeing": "1", "Context is complete and Additional Info is not required OR Context is incomplete and Additional Info is required": "5"}

{"question": "i be we my pikin just seven days ago since then i noticed anytime one breast freedom e dey struggle to soft depress if e sock small com remove em out if i put de breast back for em out e go sock small again com remove am as i dey wonder why e no dey sock breast well i no see sey the pekin get cutter e no dey breat well anytime e dey breat e sound like perceive nose block or perceive the snow i call my mother e language see am she talk say maybe as i born dey pekin or time time head or something like that where i dey think say if anything like that upon the nurses and doctors where have me delivered dey baby for now wetin dey pay me pass be say dey pekin no dey field where it dey make me worry and my mind no dey rest e no dey suck breast where and my first i dey try make e breast feed most times i go even wake am from sleep before e go suck breast small and sometimes e no go gree safe abeg wetin fit dey cause dis cutter wey dey make my pikin no dey breast where and why e dey stand like personal no splock every time e dey breast wetin free also be de reason why e know dey sock breast well", "answer": "I hear your worry, and na correct thing say you dey pay attention give your pikin. As your baby be just seven days old, the way wey e no dey suck breast well and the sound like nose block wen e dey breathe fit mean say small catarrh or block dey em nose, and since newborn dey breathe through nose, e dey hard for am to suck and breathe together. Sometimes e fit be small catarrh, but e fit also mean say the pikin get infection or breathing problem wey need quick check.

