{"question": "One woman wey dey 30 years old don born pikin few minutes wey don pass. Dem talk say di delivery go normal. But since Dem born di pikin, di pikin dey get serious problem. Di pikin no dey cry well and e no dey respond like new baby suppose respond. After birth, di pikin no cry well at all and e be like say e dey find am hard to wake up. Di pikin body fit dey stiff or e no dey move well as dem expect. Di pikin no fit suck breast well and e dey struggle to breastfeed.

