{"question": "my name na titi lola since yesterday my pikin body dey hot and e dey shake wella di pikin no fit turn him neck e com be like say di pikin neck no go turn again na only one eye e fit open wetin com bring di body wey dey hot and di neck wey no fit turn which kind result dem go see so for di pikin body wey fit make di body dey hot sotey e no fit turn en neck", "answer": "**Titi, wetin dey worry your pikin fit be serious well well - e fit be MENINGITIS.**

