{"question": "One woman dem carry come hospital this morning because she dey bleed plenty, and the bleeding don make her weak well-well. Dem ask am whether this kind thing don happen before, and she talk say e don happen about two times before. Anytime e happen, she dey feel pain and the bleeding dey come and stop, then come start again.

