{"question": "Mama wey born pikin two weeks ago begin dey see small-small blood dey come from her body. As days dey pass, e notice say wetin resemble meat or tissue and blood dey come out. Sometimes e dey feel somehow, and e neck no dey okay. E still dey get small-small pain for under belle, and anytime e see all these signs, e dey fear and confuse. E begin wonder wetin dey happen,whether na normal thing wey fit happen after woman born pikin or whether na another sickness.

