{"question": "doktor one mama wey dey live for our house begin notice say her pikin been no dey suck breast well well anytime wey she try giv em breast the pikin the sock small com stop as if him don tire the mama been also notice say the pikin no get plenty strength to the sock breast and him go sweat well well for him head and him face no be only that one the way the pikin they breathe self com change e com be like say the pikin dey breathe up and down like person wey they struggle to breathe as days com pass the mama com begin dey worry well well she com dey wonder whether na because say the pikin been no dey chop well abi whether e been get another wahala wey been dey worry the pikin breathing and the way wey e dey sweat na im she decide to go hospital go see doctor make e examine the pikin my question be say wetin fit cause pikin make e know the sock breast well well de way wey the pikin they take breeds na sign say e get health wahala which danger sign make the pikin parents them they watch out for wetin fig cause small pikin to they sweat when in the sock prists", "answer": "Doktor go tell you say di way dis pikin dey behave - as e dey tire quick wen e dey suck, dey sweat for head and face, and dey breathe fast fast like person wey dey struggle - na strong sign say di pikin fit get **heart wahala (congenital heart disease)** wey pikin fit born with am, especially heart failure. Wen small pikin dey sweat plenty (especially for head) wen e dey suck breast, na because di work wey e dey do to suck don too much for im weak heart, so di body dey struggle and dat one dey make am dey sweat and breathe fast.

